Data Types in Data Analytics:

Numerical Data (Quantitative Data):Represents numbers that can be measured or calculated.
Age = 25
Salary = 50000
Marks = 85.5

Categorical Data (Qualitative Data):Represents labels or categories, not numbers.
Gender = Male / Female
City = Bangalore / Chennai
Product = Laptop / Mobile

Boolean Data:Data with only two values: True or False.
Is Passed = True
Is Active = False

Date & Time Data:
Order Date = 2026-05-06
Login Time = 10:30 AM
